# tailscaled's environment (the package's file with the logging
# opt-out added; the package keeps this file across upgrades as a
# pacman backup file). PORT is the WireGuard listener the firewall
# opens. --no-logs-no-support stops the node from streaming its logs
# to Tailscale's log service (Arch Wiki, Tailscale: "Usage"); the
# tailnet works the same, Tailscale support would lack the logs.
PORT="41641"
FLAGS="--no-logs-no-support"
